---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Portrait from '../components/Portrait.astro';
import { timeline } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="About Pranjal Pandey | Builder, advisor & researcher" description="From first builds in 2013 to Taskflo AI and multi-agent research at IIT Jodhpur. Pranjal Pandey's background, work and education.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The person behind the work</p><h1>Hi, I'm Pranjal.</h1></header>
    <section class="about-intro"><div><p>I started writing code at 15 and never really stopped. My first real build was Gleron+, a social network I made that year. Soon after I was contributing to open source through Elgg and building websites for anyone who'd hire me. At 19 I started my own company, Corpusvision Technologies.</p><p>For the next few years I did a bit of everything. I built mobile apps for clients, designed the architecture for Ordercoro, a hyper-local food delivery platform, set up engineering teams from scratch, and laid the foundations other people would build on. Along the way I wrote my own open-source web framework, Scrawler.</p><p>At 26 I went back to school. I'm now a PhD researcher at IIT Jodhpur in multi-agent systems, studying how to divide resources and tasks fairly between agents that want different things. It sounds abstract, but I run into the same question at work every day: which tasks should AI handle, and which should stay with people?</p><p>Today I work with founders, managers and leadership teams on practical AI strategy. Most recently, that's meant building AI workflows for a US insurance business. Since May 2026 I've also been building Taskflo AI, a platform that lets companies run AI agent workflows inside their own cloud, with every action checked and logged.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/call/">Book a call</a><a class="text-link" href="/guides/#free-guide">Start with the free guide</a></div></div><Portrait /></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="section-intro"><h2>The work, over time.</h2><p>Some roles overlap. Research, advising and building have never fitted neatly into separate chapters.</p></div>
      <div class="timeline">{timeline.map(entry => <article><span class="mono">{entry.date}</span><div><h3>{entry.role}</h3><strong>{entry.organisation}</strong><p>{entry.detail}</p></div></article>)}</div>
    </section>
    <section class="section"><h2>Still asking better questions.</h2><div class="education">
      <article><span class="mono">2025 - 2028 expected</span><h3>PhD researcher</h3><p>Theoretical Computer Science, IIT Jodhpur. Multi-agent systems, fair division and allocation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/research/">Read about the research</a></article>
      <article><span class="mono">2023 - 2025</span><h3>M.Tech in Artificial Intelligence</h3><p>IIT Jodhpur. Earlier: B.Tech in Computer Science, APJ Abdul Kalam Technical University, 2020.</p></article>
    </div></section>
  </div>
</Layout>
